A '''hyperspace route''' between the [[Core Worlds|Core World]] of [[Metellos]] and the [[Unknown Regions]] [[planet]] of [[Ilum]] was [[map]]ped by [[hyperspace surveyor]]s thousands of [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Battle of Yavin]]. Those surveyors were hired by the [[Jedi Order]], who claimed sovereignty over Ilum, due to the fact Ilum was a major source of [[kyber crystal]]s, used in the construction of [[Jedi]] [[lightsaber]]s.<ref name="NoP" /> The route was rumored to only be accessible through the use of [[the Force]], and it was closely guarded by members of the Jedi Order to protect Ilum.<ref name="BMF 90">{{BuildFalconCite|80|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

